{"topicSections":[{"generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Planarity\/documentation\/Planarity\/PlanarEmbedding\/ClockwiseIncidentEdges","doc:\/\/Planarity\/documentation\/Planarity\/PlanarEmbedding\/ClockwiseNeighborIndices","doc:\/\/Planarity\/documentation\/Planarity\/PlanarEmbedding\/ClockwiseNeighbors","doc:\/\/Planarity\/documentation\/Planarity\/PlanarEmbedding\/Faces-swift.struct"],"anchor":"Structures","title":"Structures"},{"generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Planarity\/documentation\/Planarity\/PlanarEmbedding\/faceCount","doc:\/\/Planarity\/documentation\/Planarity\/PlanarEmbedding\/faces-swift.property"],"anchor":"Instance-Properties","title":"Instance Properties"},{"generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Planarity\/documentation\/Planarity\/PlanarEmbedding\/clockwiseIncidentEdges(checked:)","doc:\/\/Planarity\/documentation\/Planarity\/PlanarEmbedding\/clockwiseIncidentEdges(of:)","doc:\/\/Planarity\/documentation\/Planarity\/PlanarEmbedding\/clockwiseNeighborIndices(ofIndex:)","doc:\/\/Planarity\/documentation\/Planarity\/PlanarEmbedding\/clockwiseNeighbors(checked:)","doc:\/\/Planarity\/documentation\/Planarity\/PlanarEmbedding\/clockwiseNeighbors(of:)","doc:\/\/Planarity\/documentation\/Planarity\/PlanarEmbedding\/face(checkedFrom:alongEdgeAt:)","doc:\/\/Planarity\/documentation\/Planarity\/PlanarEmbedding\/face(from:alongEdgeAt:)","doc:\/\/Planarity\/documentation\/Planarity\/PlanarEmbedding\/rightFace(checkedFrom:alongEdgeAt:)","doc:\/\/Planarity\/documentation\/Planarity\/PlanarEmbedding\/rightFace(from:alongEdgeAt:)"],"anchor":"Instance-Methods","title":"Instance Methods"},{"generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Planarity\/documentation\/Planarity\/PlanarEmbedding\/CustomStringConvertible-Implementations"],"anchor":"Default-Implementations","title":"Default Implementations"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"@frozen","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"PlanarEmbedding","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"G","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":"> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"where","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"G","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/Graph","text":"Graph","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"content":[{"anchor":"overview","text":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A self-loop appears twice in its vertex’s order, its two ends adjacent, enclosing a face of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"length 1. Parallel copies sit side by side, each consecutive pair enclosing a face of length 2."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Each clockwise order starts at the first edge of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"incidentEdges(of:)"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Faces.","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" The face after the half-edge from u along edge e to w continues with the half-edge"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"before e in the clockwise order at w (NetworkX’s "},{"code":"next_face_half_edge","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"), so a face lies to the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"right of each of its half-edges. Faces are counted per connected component, and an isolated"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"vertex has none: two disjoint triangles have four faces."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The embedding keeps the graph it was made from (copy-on-write, so O(1)); mutating the graph"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"afterwards does not change it. When a graph ha